{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "0967be8dd960cb5e428190e737ba8b6b2539d3d39759910d0051f13561669d82", "ja": "蝶達は花に集う", "zh": "群蝶聚于花旁", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a0e9c94bc35971f7fd4e60e96d79ac650d2802b7c12d1416d0d94e291dceca2f", "ja": "デュオ公演は大成功！　取材依頼も止まない\n中、一同は打ち上げへ。美希は超高カロリー\nな鬼盛りパフェを注文し、エレナと分け合う\nことに。すっかり仲良しなふたりに、安堵\nするプロデューサーとメンバー達だった。", "zh": "双人公演大获成功！采访邀约也络绎不绝\n之际，大家一起去参加庆功宴。美希点了一份热量\n超高、堆得满满当当的芭菲，决定和艾蕾娜分着\n吃。看到两人已经变得如此要好，制作人和成员们\n都松了一口气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "78a365bdf4fe812c346671d07b745c35c9d7c4190172628a79d115dca24aa2d2", "ja": "（公演は大盛況のまま幕を閉じた！　……にも\n関わらず、取材依頼はいまだひっきりなしだ！）", "zh": "（公演在盛况中落下帷幕！……尽管如此，采访邀约至今仍接连不断！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "321e505b2ab5d5ed92bae3ef71e303229831240cbea83fba9488dd4c8428e73f", "ja": "（世間的にも注目度の高いデュオとなった。\nうん、やっぱりあのふたりは予想以上だ！）", "zh": "（她们成了备受社会关注的双人组合。嗯，果然那两个人比预想中还要厉害！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "b7de508ce4de55d156555d7b8079e31f0021252a089dc245009ddb9010d32cec", "ja": "お待たせ、みんな！\nインタビュー終わったヨ～！", "zh": "让大家久等了！\n采访结束啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "551f5efed191bb22c49d6ed7ef343538be0c6aafc92390b4278d0fc5ac131458", "ja": "まさか、打ち上げの日まで\n仕事があるとは思わなかったの。", "zh": "真没想到，居然在庆功会当天\n还有工作要做呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1004_p", "source_sha256": "047c75914d27426e2dac665441984bb0292c06ff77fbdf335afe5a6a51666aab", "ja": "ごめんな。雑誌の表紙と併せてぜひ、なんて\n言われると、流石に断りきれなくて……。", "zh": "抱歉啊。对方说希望能和杂志封面一起刊登，我实在没法拒绝……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1005_p", "source_sha256": "aeae77082d53ddad572280c25f7efa4d5b982c0ed7473d4dfd092a9dc0e7771d", "ja": "でも、それだけ好評だったって事だから。\nふたりとも、本当にお疲れさま！", "zh": "不过，这也说明反响真的很好。你们两个，真的辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "8845d60f36cfc1e45f08089973a7df720030758176e8749fee60af694e6199c8", "ja": "ええ。ふたりのステージ、とっても\nセクシーだったもの♪　将来有望ね♪", "zh": "是的。两人的舞台非常\n性感呢♪前途无量哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "53a503c1150d5db4ba61a9062a53c3d378e57811f7620fa7d21598de7385b4d2", "ja": "はい。クオリティが高くて……\n勉強になりました。", "zh": "是的。质量很高……\n让我学到了很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "aa7e3cf35fd9e0d428299f3ccdaf70f5316ba899fe5f23a286cbd5c8f153b9b5", "ja": "でも、いいのか？　エレナと美希の\n打ち上げなのに、ウチらまで参加しちゃって。", "zh": "不过，这样真的好吗？明明是艾蕾娜和美希的庆功宴，却连我们也来参加了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a174fdf6fa660608dcc1ffe079f596302ac7605d5636d5d48e87433af6cd31f3", "ja": "今回はみんなのフォローがあってこそだから。\n遠慮せず、みんなでぱあっとやろう！", "zh": "这次也是多亏了大家的支持才行。\n别客气，大家一起痛痛快快地庆祝吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "7c48d8fd4f1c59f16a29265cff5933aa5fae744dfb2e278e73a3cf606760588c", "ja": "さすが{$P$}、\nそうこなくちゃ！　それじゃあ出発なの♪", "zh": "不愧是{$P$}，这才对嘛！那我们出发咯♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1011_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "3d63a7eea5470e22255ec90cd0bda33310f0731ef1c3654ea3f2a61b49f9552c", "ja": "え～？　本当に……？\n私もこれは初めてなんだけど……。", "zh": "诶～？真的吗……？\n我也是第一次做这个，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "4893e9006bad4e2cbd98ac11fb55d6df741078afa330b8982c131294e6bd33ea", "ja": "まさに禁断って感じだな……。\nアイドルなのに……本当にいいのか？", "zh": "简直有种禁忌的感觉啊……\n明明是偶像……真的没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "d6f2fefeb05af250a4b1d792cf27ed032be613b69a0b1713d490cbfa80b3eeae", "ja": "ミキは、全然アリだと思うな♪\nみんなはやめとく？", "zh": "美希觉得完全没问题啊♪\n大家要不要算了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "a41e5d3781aaeb0cc46c72c48bc25c84c08cb5312d72806979bfdd14ea1ed819", "ja": "えっ、美希さんは平気なんですか？\nその、こういうの……。", "zh": "欸，美希，你没问题吗？\n那个，这种东西……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "a07579e2a64f3fb8dc1722ee3ddb98d49e4ff108850d8208c636154a21f3c795", "ja": "うん！　それじゃあ……『禁断の鬼盛り\nチョコバニラ山脈パフェ』頼んじゃおっと♪", "zh": "嗯！那就……我来点『禁忌的超豪华巧克力香草山脉圣代』吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "a5058ea48f67badb1cf3a5c3c91bd969222dcf40da886e5fca42fa886e6da382", "ja": "わ、若いってすごいわね……。私なんて、\n名前を見ただけでためらっちゃったのに……。", "zh": "年、年轻可真厉害啊……像我光是\n看到名字，就已经望而却步了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "d6adf7ddccf9ede1e7dd5e3a3f3e1457d0fe1259685667910f2299342299680d", "ja": "可奈なら喜びそうなものですけど……\nまさか美希さんが……。", "zh": "可奈倒是会很开心的样子……\n真没想到美希前辈竟然会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "c22cd6c149b5205917f32ef6b0cce9590939b52f7e3edca70033bc95eb28e281", "ja": "フルーツの角切りに生クリーム、山盛りのアイス……\nアイドルが摂っていいカロリーか、これ？", "zh": "水果丁、鲜奶油，还有堆得满满的冰淇淋……\n这真的是偶像可以摄取的热量吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1020_003mik", "source_sha256": "f758fbe9a58f375abfd9a788eb1c6b64e9d2aa1e920e95cccea9ff20018f727b", "ja": "カロリーのことを言うなら、\n貴音だってたくさん食べてるでしょ？", "zh": "要说卡路里的话，贵音不也吃得很多吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1021_003mik", "source_sha256": "7eeee0b1613e7ebadd7b76e7e7df99714f1a7f9629d3b2f181bdef325f88045a", "ja": "それにそれに、すっごく映えてかわいいって\n思うな♪　ねえ、これ頼んでもいいでしょ？", "zh": "而且而且，美美觉得这个超级上镜又可爱♪　呐，点这个应该可以吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1022_p", "source_sha256": "5e847cd1bb773c9ea6cdb741157a289932ae1f7446c72cb2b698e706af2614ec", "ja": "まあ構わないけど……\nこの分量、食べきれるのか？", "zh": "嗯，倒也没关系……  \n不过，这么多分量，你吃得完吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1023_003mik", "source_sha256": "649202607eb42ac1ea17219a785fa93f1391deaecf1d3193d0ab56ee11603b39", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、エレナと半分こするから♪", "zh": "没事的，美希会和艾莲娜分着吃♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1024_018ele", "source_sha256": "5057beac6849a221a82fad200c20115b18dd1f15fbfa27d17d1a79e9fa8bb44c", "ja": "うん！　それじゃあ決まりだね♪", "zh": "嗯！那就这么决定啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "7f64495e0e75ab45876afff72e9fbefbe5dc19684c2a9abcd05ffdffe5d6d09d", "ja": "すっかり仲良しだな、よかった。レッスンの時は\n出張続きですぐに手助けできなかったから……。", "zh": "已经完全成为好朋友了啊，真好。之前接连出差，没能在你们上课时及时帮上忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "04d5decafd1d944ae2695db1a6896aca3902a27aa261c8b810250133a9ec2fe5", "ja": "あー、そうだったな。ウチらも、\n美希に悪いことをしたかもって思ってたんだ。", "zh": "啊——确实是呢。我们也一直在想，\n是不是给美希添麻烦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1027_003mik", "source_sha256": "89a5f414a1280ffb94b6a57e8636a7586e8f5c40cf6290f0987a61ec748256cd", "ja": "悪いこと？\nなにかあったっけ？", "zh": "什么坏事？\n发生过什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1028_039kon", "source_sha256": "31d00d818c27d661c48871a7dbc1bd6fb8542a7c40c82fc04874dfd008da7f85", "ja": "美希ちゃん以外で行動することが多かったでしょ？\nデュオのためになればと思ってたんだけど……。", "zh": "你经常和美希以外的人一起行动，对吧？  \n我本来是想着这样会对双人组合有帮助，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1029_033sih", "source_sha256": "d900148af32ff790b716898725bcd572f965c5c02b96d928c333ac671c72be92", "ja": "そうですね。それが美希さんをイヤな気持ちに\nさせていたら、申し訳ないなと……。", "zh": "是啊。如果那让美希觉得不舒服，我就觉得很过意不去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1030_003mik", "source_sha256": "62afa9df2ce63d166838d695c8807544ed9d947c574a477d175c7d28e6e07c1d", "ja": "イヤな気持ちにはなってないよ？\nひとりぼっちは、ちょっぴり寂しかったけど……。", "zh": "没有觉得不开心哦？\n只是一个人待着，稍微有点寂寞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1031_003mik", "source_sha256": "15e0de6aca295eafc6ff98bd5c0de1294b37b97ca63adb2be6350c6eaff5ac07", "ja": "だからその分、今日はミキに付き合ってほしいな。\nあはっ☆", "zh": "所以今天想请你陪美希多待一会儿，弥补一下嘛。\n啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1032_039kon", "source_sha256": "af219d7dca184c5337971056e7b9556f1cce8c8b69e678add8cf36297f151ab4", "ja": "美希ちゃん……。", "zh": "美希……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1033_050jul", "source_sha256": "6924805f73d8f95ae6c519aa51b0e76e8bcc66941958afc87614bf027cf820ce", "ja": "美希……。", "zh": "美希……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1034_033sih", "source_sha256": "ddc93f0d7e907007c3437fa4658c50f5b785e3c8eaa8e42ce030c4810635ec19", "ja": "美希さん……。", "zh": "美希……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1035_003mik", "source_sha256": "51e4923f249e0383ee863ca60f3de04c0954f562e75ec9979bea086813f68077", "ja": "あっ！　みんな、抱きつかないでね。\nミキ、暑苦しいのはヤ！なの。", "zh": "啊！大家不要抱过来哦。\n美希不喜欢又闷又热的感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1036_p", "source_sha256": "1d2bcd72ae4f16614c1daffd9eae1dd63a653016df59adf4053c2de33d16ecfb", "ja": "まあまあ……お、頼んだパフェが\n来たみたいだぞ。あれは……。", "zh": "好啦好啦……哦，点好的芭菲\n好像送上来了。那是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1037_033sih", "source_sha256": "6a421e796f606c2b7c614155ec8639aec2965500ad5f796bae6d545cf914149a", "ja": "予想以上に大きいというか……\nバケツサイズ、ですね。", "zh": "该说是比想象中还要大……都快有水桶那么大了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1038_050jul", "source_sha256": "22d83759133b80c6671221c389cfc905887fa88c383d00a88b2dea16b4b3555a", "ja": "おいおい、マジで山脈みたい\nなのが来ちゃったけど……本当に平気か？", "zh": "喂喂，真的来了个像山脉一样的东西……真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1039_039kon", "source_sha256": "55e379d0f55e6030ee2f25dbea1543c3ad1823fb2cdc009ef232c87d701403e5", "ja": "見てるだけで胸やけしそう……けど、\nあのふたりなら、案外いけるのかしら？", "zh": "光是看着就觉得要烧心了……不过，换作那两个人，说不定意外地能吃得下呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1040_018ele", "source_sha256": "1e63fc15efc7e659224bf4da5e49e82125aa8aaac91e7df9adf6087f9452343e", "ja": "ワァ～、花火もついててとってもかわいいネ♪\nどうやってわけよっか、ミキ？", "zh": "哇～，还配着烟花，特别可爱呢♪  \n要怎么分呢，美希？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1041_003mik", "source_sha256": "d56032ecc95676ce58c6f5c32694d3f943c9398499accb0bc4ecd3908b76a275", "ja": "あ、その前に写真撮らなくちゃ。\nエレナ、{$P$}も入ろ？", "zh": "啊，在那之前得先拍张照片。艾蕾娜，{$P$}也一起入镜吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_07_1042_p", "source_sha256": "1f8d09bd90e04c61716d72bbcf570fe188974a47fdddbecafeb9813b77411897", "ja": "（まだまだ未知数のデュオ……これから\nどんな変化を見せてくれるのか、目が離せないな！）", "zh": "（前途未卜的二人组合……接下来会展现出怎样的变化，真是让人移不开视线啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
